      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccbd6ee7722a50fa8c166477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4c07747c4192530ec142e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1番になるのは絶対、このアタシなんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c857bc51f0a34a50e03e88b891c609d3acf5ede3ebe425b61d460d1e6a2e04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0b64fb970c1fa8c5542a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要挑战我？认真的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "815a6b260b90bdd3e196a87787ee04fded312924ca693c2f3a2427a59b032a69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb1986e41657f24a5f201bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！\r\n不过接下来才是重点喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256ef74ae148846f91993a5303dbc89bbc03f8fc1288774974cf7704d80f5afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a48a4f410447102d868b6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊！\r\n喂，要去晨练了哦！\r\n赶快开始准备啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9fd67931fb11ffcb22d32741d460690a313911035416b4c9eccc924aa4d9bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661b55fc3ffe55608ee3e517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡迷糊了？\r\n给我清醒点！\r\n你可是我的训练员啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfff9f11a46f2aa5e4e5d53a778df7a11b1c526ff812ce7b2212878d1d805d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb9c03f93f1748a174131915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，您好呀♪\r\n…喂，配合我一下！\r\n其他人可是都在看着的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5541c8859adffb932bed8eabc45750769cd9546fee2d8bf6cafd6ad8a92c97ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3406167a047cf150e5e227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标可是第一名，\r\n所以还请你好好准备\r\n与其相应的训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65692c6176f781a40adad8531ad76b784ca4fc63375e769df0e192f323500614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eee635e0acac6748a383aed0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠～……有点困了……\r\n但作业还得好好做。\r\n在学习方面，我也不能落后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c219890e8024681bb855c75fab464e8a9e364b617d45679b61d7c0dcdc7502d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc2cbd7e9b8351d2b1d64478",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡得最晚、起得最早。要以顶点\r\n为目标的话，理所当然要做到\r\n这两点！……我可没有在勉强自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a05e6faa0016d2057f5cf138e0e8e5da2d9d00dd54eca490f9f498d2d94a2d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7bdc9600154f4f9fd305b2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在春天的阳光中，痛快地跑一跑会很舒服吧！\r\n下一次比赛会是什么时候呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8baac5dadaf54b8832768b4d9000952f246a7726e0a9162aaa1eb82cce240baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1127e3dded469efc67738f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么热的话……\r\n会容易变得烦躁吧。\r\n一定要保持优等生的形象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc7592061ba0d29cd644df6e1e8accfdbfd3437806c07d70211727e0e790dc5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e039706348bb6d03d5b706b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了宜人的季节了呢。\r\n天气也凉快，训练和学习都会变得很顺利。\r\n帮了大忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "678d40c2704ce117391911164dfd9f3a8dfb0a19d36fdcf57f83ac4fa031c2ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d5abd9b45c7e8b1bb7fc92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你没有感冒吧？\r\n要注意好好预防哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7b9ee6e86e9554a71b55e245ee7312ffdabbd973588096b461100b0519ae7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91a7ba1229f6675b584b315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安……干嘛，\r\n是想要礼物吗？\r\n这样啊……才不给你呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "653568ac47d40fa63e46ecf216158ee9ce94e8f2cec23d8261a84cb0039510c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad11c15dbea69e7568a4795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把头发全放下来时，发质好坏\r\n会看得一清二楚。所以早上就得\r\n花加倍时间保养头发……唔唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df383e464e3bbe3658fa2c00b1537bc9ec1870ba27d3c51d85fc15a3b914b494",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321da75089efba3515f62595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔吃顿派对形式的午餐\r\n也不错吧？\r\n我来帮你挑选菜色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ec74dd047376d8a39670aa917bf54b2a8ccab320d4d24fcb6de330d71fc0b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec500e08f23391fe638ea93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个擦身而过的人都大力称赞我！\r\n说我像「冬天的公主」呢……\r\n呵呵，好棒的比喻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef8ac79a32854dfa8fff0129ca4de7bb1fff2dc207525714c56f13a75c4c6f67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e87e9121ac842bd013b2263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈送给我像香槟一样的碳酸饮料♪\r\n拿去跟帝王她们一起干杯吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a49abbb14d4842751484be5affccafed7d72f9b416a0fcd18317c9412f9d632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a6f9291a718b362983ee34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在这个时间，点起灯的化朗塔\r\n看起来一定很美……我说……\r\n要我陪你去看也不是不行喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe3f71bff5b8df94c15a3ff46aa604a6ee99a6a4be23fdd9d61e73389d2ae79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bf5697c54704735df1f056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花的盛开时间不是很短吗？\r\n所以要把樱花当作大自然的礼物，\r\n珍惜爱护才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f84b3a7b4063bfabd22ee8af889933b9ee7818b973758a9a6ae954b3e23ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d6bef9137dbba9ea3d6702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南半球的圣诞节是在夏天呢。\r\n……真希望有机会跟妈妈一起去玩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b910b3da6428519dc2e8fc614e8171bd1a1847a48b8b14fb617aca0cca3791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d54b26c9e5b186cab706ac3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天是丰收的季节呢！又有很多场\r\n大型比赛，我要让替我加油的人们\r\n露出最灿烂的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4a2dbe30944811dde8b4a2cd49ff162ec80719651399aeb7de6e4e4bde77d53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c65b1423a2e2458d41d14f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，圣诞老人最活跃的季节到了！\r\n没时间怕冷了，来，\r\n一起上街去吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb62855cae6eb144300c476aa4116ebf82e62feddb695dba24dcac1e6ab3f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acebc31c0e0032bb425e3ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e67c9e830d3831547af6b650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5a756fcdf499173351f12d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽前辈虽然稍微有点可怕……\r\n但那份无懈可击的气场真令人向往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "234970a4319669cc66a6da6f53456b2003fe1658231f422b27642861eb69acf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e08f98028a3050132f8ede4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个王冠头饰，很适合我吧？\r\n这可是妈妈为了庆祝我考上\r\n特雷森学园而送给我的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d586c0d50854e41893fb7a941f3daa068837ba897f389b3c3bf9818d405ffe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526d70762962acc23eb02494",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子小姐很温柔啊。\r\n不但分给我好喝的茶叶。\r\n而且有时还会送一些有用的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cffc0c40d73732847288446672c7190ae9819893b26a0c4c6e3ed75d4854bb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97364ff2c2542aac7904e761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……今天的电视占卜……\r\n居然是第二名这么微妙的名次……\r\n虽然不讨厌但也谈不上喜欢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "108521da1d40419db886a7357496de449c42bf7d6e053c5f8b00fb4cf7ba1332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3ec81843022965ddcd3ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，别发呆了！\r\n时间都浪费了不是嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caf09668ea2599b51d4feb92a6210966f3c402ccd5aed53bcab8b1fb78153bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdcbc9728b7e8527abddb221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…总感觉衣服有点…又变紧了？\r\n哈啊～…待会得去改改。也得考虑到\r\n还处于成长期的情况呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9674beb8139e5492fadf385268d71278a4e23ae5a972bb2a85389a1641f13b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a2ff0b6c0913718d7af551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最快最强的完美马娘……\r\n我觉得自己正在一点点地接近理想了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "718a57dae2e4923fc30062774dcb33781107253cdd9b75160f857ba2a961d495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49fcb252af1998798c6b3dab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得在赛场上留下能够称得上\r\n这件衣服的成果呢……那么今天也请\r\n严格地训练我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeadd2d531ef0f3691e6b811bc63bd238ff7bbbb6dd24936a2cb5b86d450f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:461f757d188d49231c4dc5df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时何地，无论对方是谁！\r\n都要第一个冲过终点！\r\n这就是我的原则！",
      "source_fingerprint": "976cd5779111e7eaf346a39c539df00841755a1df3dabd49dcf9f4a6c2cef93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3af2fff0f90f4aee72e4235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？如果第一个到校，\r\n比任何人都快一步开始晨练的话，\r\n心情就会变得很好哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd68fa1429d0d73a59b4c094a271c5b5537b4c2d536f645afa3bdef1a061a063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9eb21d416a23956596e97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不好，训练前\r\n必须要买点香蕉才行！\r\n营养可不能跟不上呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03fc6024fdac8e4fdc1eee17cf6713a501489667e0badacf686904599777231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6cfe29233019c5520aed9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想在晚上点些熏香的，\r\n但伏特加说什么“这样会睡不踏实的！”。\r\n非要阻止我这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d41e2c21b013891a9714e873456fc6c3041386d86f5476f32278840cae7c460",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5167fee5325a86b39bb2abd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说“春眠不觉晓”，\r\n但如果要以第一为目标的话，\r\n可没有睡懒觉的时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777bd5b967c5a989783f5d1c4158e9871c0508ee90214ce6a750d04cdd37af46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ce2a35ccba69594e84b488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天真好啊！\r\n因为白天的时间变长了，\r\n可以进行更多的锻炼呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3040eed915e012bd39bf3fef4df9188cefed85b4789c62fbc77018d508566cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e1c0abe223ed27e5d4658c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，虽说到了秋天，\r\n但你不会吃特别多吧？\r\n要好好克制住哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a91835a5217bfcdf6d2892010ec0ad50fe66b6a5dc07be31081ff235f49c9a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c50d8472d50219bcebb1924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷……什么的才没有啦！\r\n这种程度，完全没问题！\r\n喂，要开始训练了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9bd929b5d4fb144030895c4da3f32c82d2446da8fc749fef1c74558773c76d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c4c55b3707c32ea9e1c01e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩托车模型准备好了，包装也很完美，\r\n接着就只要……唔！不、不是的！\r\n这是……呃……总之不是那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6e9f03d02e59491f7165834e514499cb6847d0eaaa087476c23cf6931a7b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d618bc21a11b79ce4c6be881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～气槽前辈……那跟大人\r\n都能对等交谈的样子，好帅气喔。\r\n总有一天我也想象她那样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a70c4b91a121e0458927ba7ea64b0e9b20c7d3b411ac3ea19aba1fda5d8d5b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "91017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
